   "noun": "house",
   "label": "House",
   "line": "The finished house: one side of a one-story duplex with a full new second story under a 6:12 gable, beside the existing one-story unit. Choose Explore to turn the model or go to a room."
  },
  {
   "id": "front",
   "progress": 0.22,
   "end": 0.32,
   "noun": "entry side",
   "label": "Entry side",
   "line": "The entry side: the porch roof along both units, the new gable and the small gable over the upstairs closet, with new windows above the existing ones."
  },
  {
   "id": "roof",
   "progress": 0.38,
   "end": 0.48,
   "noun": "roof",
   "label": "Roof",
   "line": "The roof lifts away: a new 6:12 gable over the addition with flared rakes, a small gable over the closet bump, and the existing roof kept over the other unit and the porches."
  },
